Har service = ek hi responsibility honi chahiye

Location Service → Ride lifecycle, GPS tracking
Chat Service      → Messaging, real-time communication

Inka kaam ALAG hai, sirf data share kar rahe hain
(Redis ke through) — isका matlab ye nahi ki
unhe ek service banana chahiye!




1. Scaling issue:
   Agar chat traffic badh jaaye (zyada messages)
   toh poori location-service bhi scale karni padegi
   (jabki location service ko zarurat nahi)

2. Deployment risk:
   Chat me bug fix karna ho → location service
   bhi redeploy hogi → location APIs down ho
   sakti hain temporarily (jo critical hai —
   real-time GPS tracking)

3. Code complexity:
   Ek service me location models + chat models
   + dono ka business logic — confusing ho jaata hai

4. Independent failure:
   Abhi agar chat service crash ho jaaye,
   location service chalti rahegi (ride tracking
   continue rahega) — agar merge kar diya,
   ek crash dono ko le jayega!